{"id":"Wdfa5a4b7a3acb370c0959d75","zh":"","en":"subgrade cumulative deformation","name":"subgrade cumulative deformation","language":"en","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C934fa2b1b1e956b25f1e","families":[],"definition_zh":"路基在循环荷载作用下逐渐积累的变形。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于描述和预测反复列车荷载下路基变形的逐步积累，并分析其动力效应。关注的是卸载后不能完全恢复的变形及其长期发展。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wdfa5a4b7a3acb370c0959d75","text":"subgrade cumulative deformation","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S09d835c25ac010fedb7b","source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"For the interaction of the two modules, after each cyclic jump, the subgrade cumulative deformation was mapped to the track system.","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S9e87c0cbb4a225d8f4f0","source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The results show that the calculation model presented in this paper can well reveal the evolution law of subgrade cumulative deformation under cyclic dynamic vehicular loads.","citations":[{"source_id":"P132","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P132":{"id":"P132","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","authors":"李正,徐磊,王卫东,杜香刚,余志武,刘鹏飞,曾志平","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231073","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"李正等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"车辆反复加载后逐步积累的路基不可恢复变形，是主要预测对象。","language":"zh","source_id":"P132","paper_slug":"2024-study-on-the-prediction-of-the-cumulative-deformation-of-high-speed-railway-subgrade-under-the-cycli","title":"车辆循环动载下高速铁路路基累积变形预测研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W4f31eda179d794d193176390","name":"路基累积变形","languag